    "text": "Idaho\n13 Strange and Beautiful Places That Prove Idaho is Full of Secrets\nBy Michelle Heart,\n3 hours agoThere are a few things that Idaho is known to do very well. Potatoes. Huckleberries. College football. One thing the Gem State doesn’t get enough credit for? How good it is at keeping things hidden. I’m not talking about in some sort of creepy, government cover-up sort of way....",
